 class=\"entity-link\">Roshar</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Character:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/cosmere/taravangian\" class=\"entity-link\">Taravangian</a>\n            — <a href=\"/cosmere/taravangian\" class=\"entity-link\">Taravangian</a> becomes Odium&#039;s <a href=\"/cosmere/vessel\" class=\"entity-link\">Vessel</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Character:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/cosmere/kholin-family/dalinar-kholin\" class=\"entity-link\">Dalinar Kholin</a>\n            — Dalinar stands against Odium.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Concept:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/cosmere/vessel\" class=\"entity-link\">Vessel</a>\n            — <a href=\"/cosmere/vessel\" class=\"entity-link\">Vessel</a>&#039;s entry mentions Odium — <a href=\"/cosmere/shard\" class=\"entity-link\">Shard</a> of divine hatred.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Location:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/cosmere/shadesmar\" class=\"entity-link\">Shadesmar</a>\n            — <a href=\"/cosmere/shadesmar\" class=\"entity-link\">Shadesmar</a>&#039;s entry mentions Odium — <a href=\"/cosmere/shard\" class=\"entity-link\">Shard</a> of divine hatred.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Series:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/cosmere/the-stormlight-archive\" class=\"entity-link\">The Stormlight Archive</a>\n            — Odium&#039;s entry mentions <a href=\"/cosmere/the-stormlight-archive\" class=\"entity-link\">The Stormlight Archive</a> — <a href=\"/cosmere/the-stormlight-archive\" class=\"entity-link\">The Stormlight Archive</a> is a high fantasy novel series written by American author Brandon Sanderson, planned to consist of ten novels.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Concept:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/cosmere/stormlight\" class=\"entity-link\">Stormlight</a>\n            — Odium&#039;s entry mentions <a href=\"/cosmere/stormlight\" class=\"entity-link\